```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoSessionKey: Conversation starts

    NoSessionKey --> SessionKeyActive: generateSessionKey()
    note right of SessionKeyActive
        - Ephemeral key pair created
        - Threshold: 100 messages
        - Message count: 0
    end note

    SessionKeyActive --> MessageSent: Send encrypted DM
    MessageSent --> SessionKeyActive: count < 100
    note right of MessageSent
        Increment message counter
        Check rotation threshold
    end note

    MessageSent --> RotationNeeded: count >= 100
    note right of RotationNeeded
        Threshold reached
        Trigger key rotation
    end note

    RotationNeeded --> DestroyOldKey: Secure key destruction
    note right of DestroyOldKey
        - Clear old private key from memory
        - Remove from KeyManagementService
        - Zero out sensitive data
    end note

    DestroyOldKey --> GenerateNewKey: Create new session key
    note right of GenerateNewKey
        - New ephemeral key pair
        - Reset message count to 0
        - New rotation threshold
    end note

    GenerateNewKey --> SessionKeyActive: New session active

    SessionKeyActive --> [*]: Conversation ends / destroy()
    note left of [*]
        Clean up:
        - Destroy session keys
        - Clear message cache
        - Remove thread data
    end note
```
